{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_st01",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_st01",
  "title": "悍將之心",
  "storyCode": "RI-ST-1",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_st01.txt",
  "sourceHash": "09e892a65be5568c96f4869144895e5b105b2c6de38615e2a80070a7d510f947",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_temple_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘶，啊......有點痛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉維爾，你終於醒了！你沒事吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事沒事，一點小傷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比起這個，祖瑪瑪那個就是她一直以來在搗鼓的機器嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，據說叫做“巨大的醜東西”。太可惡了，居然......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也太酷了吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "居然把......咦，誒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，可是那個大傢伙明明把嘉維爾你打倒了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是它確實很厲害啊，雖然我只瞟到一眼就昏過去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔唔，確實......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，還真是沒想到她居然真的造出了這樣的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然可露希爾也偶爾會造一些古怪的東西出來，不過祖瑪瑪這台恐怕可露希爾看到也會驚歎吧，哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誒，在羅德島那樣的東西有很多嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "有。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "哇哇哇，羅德島好可怕......"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "哈哈，羅德島可是超乎你這小腦袋想像的地方。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "沒有這麼醜的。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "哈哈，這麼一說倒是真的，那台機器要是可露希爾看到估計要瘋了。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？神廟怎麼倒了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "被那台怪獸轟倒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，那這麼說，祭典已經散了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也就是說，祖瑪瑪成為了大酋長？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然一開始所有人都嚇了一跳，但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_temple_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我毀掉神廟的原因，很簡單。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想告訴大家，這種傳統該結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "靠拳頭可以打十個人，像嘉維爾那樣的，或許可以打一百個，但是，再多呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算是嘉維爾也解決不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就是只靠拳頭的極限。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，工具不一樣，我們部族製造出來的這台“巨大的醜東西”，可以輕易地打敗嘉維爾，也可以輕易地讓神廟塌掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就是工具的力量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而借助工具，你們也可以變得這麼強！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以接下來，是機器的時代！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_temple_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家都被她說服了，所以......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以她成為了大酋長嗎，嗨呀，這下真是輸了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "不甘心嗎？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "嗯？沒有，輸了就是輸了。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "嘿，博士，不用想安慰我的話，我是真的不難過。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "可別不服輸啊，嘉維爾。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "哼，當然，我是誰？"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，不過，特米米，抱歉啊，我這麼一搞，你都還沒上場就結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......沒事的，就算是我先上場，應該也是一樣的結果吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，這倒沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，博士，接下來怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "找引擎和其他人。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "哦對，不管怎麼說，引擎不找回來，我們可回不去了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "而且這麼一說，祭典上還真是一個我們的人都沒出現啊，他們該不會是迷路了吧。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "博士也沒想好嗎，沒事，慢慢想吧，距離假期結束還有時間呢。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "觀光？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "哈哈，我就喜歡博士你這種地方，那就一邊找引擎和其他人，一邊觀光吧！"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個，這個......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？那邊那兩個人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，哥哥，你沒事吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_071",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒事，我只是，有點......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哥哥，哥哥！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "巫醫，這裡有巫醫嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，讓我看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉維爾？你沒死嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我才沒那麼容易死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "少廢話，把你哥哥放平在地上給我看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特米米，把我的醫藥箱給我拿過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_temple_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我哥哥沒事嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒死，但是狀況不太好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼吸短促，有血性泡沫痰......嗯？體表有源石結晶分佈？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......博士，我初步判斷這是礦石病感染造成的心力衰竭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是石頭病。症狀還不算重，我的醫藥箱裡有應急的藥，不過需要馬上接受治療。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把他扶起來，不能躺著，我先來給他補充一些氧氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這也是石頭病搞的鬼？嘖，我就說過讓哥哥不要勉強的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你叫什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我叫尤吉，這是我的哥哥，尤塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是哪個部族的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是森蚺部族的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉維爾，你怎麼了，表情變得好可怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先別說話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我再問你，祖瑪瑪為了造她的鋼鐵怪獸，有沒有讓你們去礦區採礦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有啊，怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉啊，博士，看來無論如何，我必須去找祖瑪瑪一趟了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "因為“石頭病”？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "不愧是博士，一下就想到了我在想的東西。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "博士你這麼聰明，應該已經察覺了吧。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "看來觀光要暫緩了。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "抱歉啊，博士，但是這件事我不做不行。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，我們這裡和外界幾乎沒有什麼聯繫，對你和其他幹員來說，一定是個很落後的地方吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但這樣的地方也有這樣的地方的好處，那就是，你也聽到了，在我們這裡，礦石病只是一種被叫做“石頭病”的普通疾病。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "偶爾會有人染上它，也會有人因為這種病死去。但是對我們來說，它沒有什麼特殊的，因為什麼病都有人死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家會像照顧普通病人一樣照顧得了礦石病的人，而大家對它唯一的瞭解，就是去礦場可能會得這種病。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以在很久以前，就已經很少有人去礦場了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你的礦石病......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉維爾的病是為了救我才得的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，當時特米米這孩子還小，有一次溜進礦場深處，我去救她，回來之後就得了病。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幸好她沒有得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是我替嘉維爾得就好了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不許說這種話，誰得病都不好，得了病也只能說運氣不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "所以，你真的是被排擠才離開這裡的？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，你問這個問題好幾次了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "自從我得了病後，其他族人什麼事都不讓我做，打獵不讓我去，聚會不讓我參加。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尤其是特米米這丫頭，乾脆從別的部族跑過來，天天黏著我，什麼都幫我做了，害我什麼都做不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最後，連祭典他們乾脆都不想讓我參加。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "漸漸的，所有人都用一種“嘉維爾你什麼都不要做了，我們會幫你做好”的方式對待我......但這並不是我想要的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉維爾從那個時候開始就不怎麼笑了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我一怒之下，才在祭典途中一個人衝上去把所有人打了一頓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚嗚，都怪我當時太想照顧嘉維爾了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......確實這也是一種排擠。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "其實吧，在我們這裡，不能打或者沒有活力的人，那就是廢人。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "我寧願你讓我做些危險的事，也不想被限制自由什麼都做不了。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "博士，你是不是覺得很可笑？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "但其實我也覺得很可笑，我出來之後才知道，原來礦石病是那麼被人厭惡的一種病。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "我花了很長時間才瞭解清楚所有的現實。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "我也想體驗這種排擠啊！",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "嘖，博士，說話小心點，不然我揍你。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "我知道你的意思，在外面，被人唾棄才是礦石病患者的常態。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "但對那時的我來說，這可是真正的煎熬。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不對，被你帶歪了，我要說的不是這個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？我要說什麼來著？"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "鋼鐵怪獸。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "哦對。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "博士你倒是也幫我想一想。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "哦，我想起來了。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "欠我錢的事。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "放屁。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "哦，想起來了。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要說的是，之前看到的時候沒細想，但是仔細想想，那台怪獸，明顯用到了許多鐵礦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再加上祖瑪瑪說的話。也就是說，祖瑪瑪那傢伙，絕對讓手下去開採鐵礦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼說起來，確實有聽說過呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本來這也就算了，只是在外圍開採的話，不會有很大問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但既然出現了得病的人，我不能坐視不理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她想要搞什麼機械時代我不管，但她如果忽視其他人的生命，那我就必須給她來幾拳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我支持你。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "謝謝你，博士。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "哦哦，博士的眼神也變得尖銳起來了。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "成為了好醫生啊，嘉維爾。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "嘿，那當然。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉維爾......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特米米，祖瑪瑪的部族在哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誒，我也不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，嘉維爾，我才不管你怎麼想當醫生的事，我哥哥到底怎麼樣了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？你聽得懂我們說的薩爾貢語？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽得懂啊，因為族長有在教我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......祖瑪瑪那傢伙，究竟想幹什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖，不管這個。總之，特米米，讓你的人把這個人送回你的部族，讓在那裡的Lancet-2先對這個人進行一些治療。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你要幹什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不想讓你哥哥死的話，就把他交給我，相信我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這樣的話，我也一起把他帶回去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？你不跟我一起去嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，不、不是！我當然想和嘉維爾你一起去，只是我有些事情要準備，之後我會追上你們的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼事，要我幫忙嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不、不用！我自己就可以解決的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉維爾，你還記得大瀑布嗎？我們就在那裡會合吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，你是嘉維爾，我相信你，但我也要一起去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用，你去了也沒用，而且我有事讓你去做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你回去告訴祖瑪瑪，我有事要找她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
